Punch Out par ab 10% tolerance lag jayega. Ye stopTracking mein add hua hai. Syntax check pass hua hai. Ye abhi GitHub par push nahi hua aur AWS par bhi deploy nahi hua.

Kaise kaam karta hai: Punch Out par GPS ka asli KM nikalta hai, aur uske upar 10% jud jaata hai. Jaise 50 km par 55 km, aur 110 km par 121 km.

Jo maine alag rakha hai:

Asli GPS KM acceptedDistance aur rawGpsDistance mein surakshit rehta hai.
Extra 10% manualDistanceAdded mein jaata hai, saath mein reason bhi likha hota hai. Jaise: 10% Punch Out tolerance: GPS 50 km + 5 km = 55 km.
Isse admin ko hamesha dikh sakta hai ki kitna GPS ka hai aur kitna adjustment. Maine ise chhupaya nahi hai, jaisa pichhli baar kaha tha.

Percentage badalna ho: AWS ke .env mein PUNCH_OUT_TOLERANCE_PCT=10 set kar dein, code badalne ki zaroorat nahi. Set na karein to bhi 10 hi chalega.

Dhyan rakhne wali baatein:

Ye bonus sirf Punch Out par lagta hai. Shift ke dauran live dashboard par asli GPS KM hi dikhega, aur 10% Punch Out ke baad dikhega.
Agar kisi session par baad mein reconcile API chali, to wo KM ko sirf GPS ledger se dobara nikalti hai. Isse bonus hat sakta hai. Zaroorat ho to main reconcile ko bhi bonus ke saath adjust kar sakta hoon.